suite: xyce
what: a third opinion: VerA's library in ngspice against Xyce's own built-in model of the same version, on the DC tests of the model's va-models qaSpec (tests/fixtures/external/va-models/<name>.qa), compared with the CMC rule
url: none beyond the va-models checkout (its MANIFEST pins it); Xyce 7.10.0 comes from `nix develop .#benchmarking`
license: Apache-2.0 (this folder is VerA's own); nothing of Xyce (GPL-3.0) is stored
files: MANIFEST
#
# model <va-models name> <Xyce device letter> <Xyce level> <Xyce pins, the qaSpec's names>
# (`Xyce -param`: d 2002 DIODE_CMC 2.0.0, q 12 VBIC 1.3 4T, q 234 HICUM v2.4.0,
#  q 504 MEXTRAM 504.12.1, m 103 PSP103VA, m 111 BSIM-CMG v111.2.1, m 54 BSIM4)
model diode_cmc d 2002 a,k
model vbic q 12 c,b,e,s
model hicum2 q 234 c,b,e,s,t
model mextram q 504 c,b,e,s
model psp103 m 103 d,g,s,b
model bsimcmg m 111 d,g,s,e
model bsim4 m 54 d,g,s,b
